# CODEOWNERS — default reviewers per path
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/setting-up-your-repository-for-healthy-contributions/about-code-owners
#
# Pattern: path  @github-handle
# The last matching pattern wins, like .gitignore.
#
# Action required: replace @Quiarom with the maintainer's
# actual GitHub handle, and add any co-maintainer handles. The
# file is parsed by GitHub on every push; until handles resolve,
# PRs will not request a review automatically.

# Default: all changes require the maintainer's review.
*       @Quiarom

# Documentation can be reviewed by either maintainer.
# /docs/  @Quiarom
# /README.md  @Quiarom
# /HACKATHON_FAQ.md  @Quiarom
# /AGENTS.md  @Quiarom
# /CONTRIBUTING.md  @Quiarom
# /CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md  @Quiarom
# /SECURITY.md  @Quiarom
# /NOTICE  @Quiarom

# Safety-critical paths require a second maintainer.
# /internal/transport/  @Quiarom @co-maintainer
# /internal/adapters/tplinkwr841v8/  @Quiarom @co-maintainer
# /internal/architecture_test.go  @Quiarom @co-maintainer
